                                                "example_id": "7ac0fbe9-bef8-4a0b-8392-0146c2c83dbf",
                                                "sense_id": "3c0eb017-705a-30fb-8326-98ee940d5cea",
                                                "text": "In addition to the extra labour at Christmas, because services kept running on Christmas Day many of the staff did not get the day off. […] Moreover, after Christmas Day he got a few days off and had \"...a real old jolly time, as only we men of the iron road know how\"."
